{"title":"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle with sides of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Let the bisector of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4056d41f42aa8a00adca0ff5d1209b6bb0e92d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> cut <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c83b185440424c8e67c008c02649daf94e6837dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2ab\\cos \\frac{C}{2}}{a+b}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"78\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/0048ffb9a9b50579803ae2f3056dfe46e5000335.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=d.$\" width=\"67\" height=\"12\" /> Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f64309b971755578af1787db24ed38fae8e0af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\triangle ABC]=[\\triangle ACD]+[\\triangle BCD].$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"259\" height=\"18\" /> This can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03401ca84e35978c152f7f73a335d7068167000.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 a b \\sin C=\\frac12 a d \\sin \\frac C2 +\\frac12 b d \\sin \\frac C2 .$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/6/936b5763bac1da673a30533d6d41c9c737b69f07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin C=2\\sin \\frac C2 \\cos \\frac C2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"172\" height=\"37\" /> the expression can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa812a95e559b7832e0fcb4e9c68a3c88da4c48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab\\cos \\frac C2=d(a+b).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"39\" /> Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/b/4fb2425c6b4f3ee240f01f721b86b7bd3b2ef9fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32455a817383deba1f4046096109c54289a02e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=\\frac{2ab\\cos \\frac C2}{a+b},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"133\" height=\"42\" /> as desired.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO\">1969 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017063010\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 102/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1021/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2947/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.074      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    8.074      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3611:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017063010 and revision id 27889. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}